If you've been reading for the last few days,  you know I'm taking a poll
of nethack players on two questions.  All votes are due on or before this
Friday,  June 8th.  The questions again:

Regarding movement onto water,  would you like:

A - No confirmation (current implementation)
B - confirmation (as in for peaceful monsters,  default ON)
C - confirmation (ditto,  except default OFF)

Regarding attacking particular monsters (like floating eyes),  would you
like:

E - No confirmation (current implementation)
F - optional confirmations for each monster name (default off,  of course)

A verification note will be sent to all voters,  but I will not make
strenuous efforts to deal with problem return addresses.

Remember that this is merely an opinion poll,  and is in no way binding
on the development team.  It is being performed simply for information
gathering purposes.


